# Telegram bot for RSVP — notifications + /list & /count commands.
#
# 1. Create a bot: open @BotFather in Telegram → /newbot → copy the token.
# 2. Paste the token below.
# 3. Start the bot (`npm run bot`), open your bot in Telegram, send any message.
#    It will reply with your chat id — paste it into TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID.
# 4. Restart the bot. Done — every RSVP now pings you, and /list / /count work.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=
